  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w25.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w25.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "決勝の前夜、街は祭りになった。復興した街の、最初の祭り。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "提灯、屋台、揚げ物の湯気。滅亡から五週間の街とは、誰も思わないだろう。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "うちの選手たちは、屋台を三軒、完売させた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "規格外の食欲に、屋台のおやじたちの悲鳴と万歳が同時に出た。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "明日の相手の話は、誰もしない。しないことで、全員が考えているのが分かる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "決勝の相手、シャハル。空の王者、最古の竜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "会場の上を一周した、あの翼の主だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "街の賭け札は、正直だった。倍率は、うちに厳しい。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "宴の輪を少し外れて、展望デッキで夜風に当たった。手帳を開く。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "第一週からの頁を、ぱらぱらと戻る。一行ズレた判、三つの扉、希望欄、特訓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "滅亡、復興。……よく来たものだ、ここまで。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夜空の星が、一列、消えた。消えたんじゃない——隠れたのだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "大きな翼の影に。風が、提灯を全部揺らして、それが降りてきた。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "シャハル。間近で見る空の王者は、静かで、大きくて、夜そのものより夜だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "王者は名乗らず、私も名乗らなかった。お互い、知っているからだ。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "王者は、ひとつだけ聞いた。「あなたのチームは——何年、もちますか」",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "何年。竜の時間の単位だ。何千年を生きる王者が、できたばかりのチームに、年数を聞いている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "馬鹿にする響きは、無かった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "本当に、知りたい声だった。耳が、思わず立った。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私は、答えた。何と答えたかは——明日の試合で、見せることにする。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.direction.mimi.shift.010",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w25.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "王者は翼を広げた。飛び立つ間際、独り言が夜風に残った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「……四百年ぶりです。明日が楽しみで、眠れそうにないのは」星が、一列ずつ、戻ってくる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "監督が寝不足では、話にならない。私は、宴の輪へ走った。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w25.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "明日も、いつも通りが続くという約束だ。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s1.w25.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
  "debug": {
